In a traditional website, when you move from one page to another :-
Home → Server → New HTML page → Browser reload

In React SPA :-
React Application → One HTML page → JavaScript changes the UI → No full page reload

For example :-
My React App
     |
     ├── Home
     ├── About
     └── Contact

When the user clicks About, React can display :-
About Page

So that without completely reloading the browser page.

Simple Example :- SPA Code
Real applications normally use React Router for navigation.
